        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Luge: The Journey</strong> is a single-player arcade adventure game. Play as Waddles the Penguin as you and your little brother, Toddles, brave the dangerous arctic mountains to spread Christmas cheer to your fellow penguins in the towns below. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, avoid avalanches, and survive blizzard conditions as you luge down treacherous mountain paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute the items you collect to penguins in need with mini, arcade-style shooting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story of famed mountaineer, Harold R. Teck’s, mysterious disappearance during his attempt at a first descent of the Stormy Summit Trail. Piece together the mystery as you dig up old journal pages and clues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the immersive and beautiful arctic landscape with twinkling stars, wild forests, and cozy, Christmas-themed villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race down icy luges, navigating hairpin turns, corkscrews, and ramps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scarves and other items along the way to distribute to penguins in the villages below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid avalanches and other perils along the luge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini, arcade-style games in the villages to distribute the scarves and other items you collected to penguins in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues about the missing explorer, Harold R. Teck, by digging up journal pages and talking to other penguins.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Luge: The Journey</strong> is a single-player arcade adventure game. Play as Waddles the Penguin as you and your little brother, Toddles, brave the dangerous arctic mountains to spread Christmas cheer to your fellow penguins in the towns below. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/b107af5c4c0e1ecf9c549969e8dd32aa.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items, avoid avalanches, and survive blizzard conditions as you luge down treacherous mountain paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/e245d018786a491274c8701b04cd3043.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute the items you collect to penguins in need with mini, arcade-style shooting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/cd9ba6d203d58e0ee5b91f99e7e006e8.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story of famed mountaineer, Harold R. Teck’s, mysterious disappearance during his attempt at a first descent of the Stormy Summit Trail. Piece together the mystery as you dig up old journal pages and clues. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.poster.avif?t=1764533897\" width=816 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.webm?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054880/extras/073a3a1b733dbcded4a3ff33f26310e0.mp4?t=1764533897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the immersive and beautiful arctic landscape with twinkling stars, wild forests, and cozy, Christmas-themed villages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race down icy luges, navigating hairpin turns, corkscrews, and ramps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect scarves and other items along the way to distribute to penguins in the villages below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid avalanches and other perils along the luge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini, arcade-style games in the villages to distribute the scarves and other items you collected to penguins in need.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues about the missing explorer, Harold R. Teck, by digging up journal pages and talking to other penguins.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Slide through the dangerous mountain passes to spread Christmas cheer to your fellow penguins — and solve a mystery along the way. Lighthearted with ambient winter environments, this is a game for all ages to enjoy during the Christmas season.",
